    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of ruthless insects. Test yourself as a spider, a skilled hunter. Your web is your weapon. Wrap your prey in a cocoon to immobilize and eat it. Defeat the swarm of insects and become the top predator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all enemy waves to complete the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat your prey to gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade active and passive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new spider-web powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and adapt to new enemy evolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create unique builds of your spider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of ruthless insects. Test yourself as a spider, a skilled hunter. Your web is your weapon. Wrap your prey in a cocoon to immobilize and eat it. Defeat the swarm of insects and become the top predator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all enemy waves to complete the level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat your prey to gain experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade active and passive skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new spider-web powers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive and adapt to new enemy evolutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create unique builds of your spider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the world of ruthless insects. Test yourself as a spider, a skilled hunter. Your web is your weapon. Wrap your prey in a cocoon to immobilize and eat it. Defeat the swarm of insects and become the top predator!",
